    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/77c5fbed87e99c8d5615cb119888bbe3.avif?t=1743372114\" /></span>Embark on a strategic journey in <i>Starcade FACTIONS</i> \u2014where every move could be your path to victory or defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/261645e606a2a0aa4d1be97215ae9a5d.webp?t=1743372114\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn offers up to three powerful actions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new ships for your fleet...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4c1fa8d65a5b6b93dcd396fd78c57552.poster.avif?t=1743372114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4c1fa8d65a5b6b93dcd396fd78c57552.webm?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4c1fa8d65a5b6b93dcd396fd78c57552.mp4?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a powerful Action card...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4aa0ade555bf79dec6c676a01965248c.poster.avif?t=1743372114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4aa0ade555bf79dec6c676a01965248c.webm?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4aa0ade555bf79dec6c676a01965248c.mp4?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move ships and launch attacks...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/88146164d7709f9a18891915fd95e642.poster.avif?t=1743372114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/88146164d7709f9a18891915fd95e642.webm?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/88146164d7709f9a18891915fd95e642.mp4?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear: capture the enemy\u2019s Flagship and claim your victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/40429452becc3d86bf46c69206cad382.poster.avif?t=1743372114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/40429452becc3d86bf46c69206cad382.webm?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/40429452becc3d86bf46c69206cad382.mp4?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/9717bab660e91b5b9e07d6c50e660d74.webp?t=1743372114\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fast-paced, turn-based strategy game, you're not just a commander; you're the mastermind behind epic space battles. Engage in quick, action-packed games that last just about 5 minutes, perfect for when you need a quick burst of high-octane action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/d7a5ab3f5b9fbdb3798957eb617a51d2.webp?t=1743372114\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 10 unique ship types like Fighters, Medics, and Builders, you\u2019ll uncover layers of strategy that are easy to grasp but challenging to master. The simplicity of the controls means anyone can jump in, but only the best can truly dominate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/ebe575feb3026c883563b1e61141d3eb.avif?t=1743372114\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As a passion project from a solo developer, Starcade FACTIONS is brimming with potential. Your support can help it reach new heights\u2014download it for free and join the growing community today!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/77c5fbed87e99c8d5615cb119888bbe3.avif?t=1743372114\" /></span>Embark on a strategic journey in <i>Starcade FACTIONS</i> \u2014where every move could be your path to victory or defeat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/261645e606a2a0aa4d1be97215ae9a5d.webp?t=1743372114\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn offers up to three powerful actions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build new ships for your fleet...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4c1fa8d65a5b6b93dcd396fd78c57552.poster.avif?t=1743372114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4c1fa8d65a5b6b93dcd396fd78c57552.webm?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4c1fa8d65a5b6b93dcd396fd78c57552.mp4?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a powerful Action card...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4aa0ade555bf79dec6c676a01965248c.poster.avif?t=1743372114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389480/extras/4aa0ade555bf79dec6c676a01965248c.webm?t=1743372114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: